op=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5c1f4e2fff665b6df257fea17350eb5a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9f8d69ac/uploads/origins/87254c5f-ffbb-45fc-bf1d-07ec5ae1dd57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5c1f4e2fff665b6df257fea17350eb5a, https://si.imgix.net/9f8d69ac/uploads/origins/87254c5f-ffbb-45fc-bf1d-07ec5ae1dd57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ca85077ea4471ab879b9d9a890bedd9b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9f8d69ac/uploads/origins/87254c5f-ffbb-45fc-bf1d-07ec5ae1dd57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ccaf363a4430089d55b967550976e981 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、Opaleさん。\n前回もありがとうございました。この度は、知り合いのVtuberの澄花ハクさんのファンアートを依頼したいのですがよろしいでしょうか？\n\n参考画像については、下半身の設定はちびキャラ版しかない、お許しください\nhttps://x.com/SumikaHaku89/status/2015293771966226827/photo/1\nhttps://x.com/SumikaHaku89/status/2019709314152403079/photo/1\n（抱いてるのはファンイメージの澄子です、頭の上にみかんが乗ってる犬です)\n癒し系Vtuberなので、この方向への構図がほしいですが、詳しい指定はありません、Opaleさんにお任せします。\n澄花ハクさんにプレゼントとして送りますので、Xでのポストに使われる可能性があります。\n\nご検討いただければ幸いです、よろしくお願いします。\n\n中国語は理解できるらしいなので、以下は中国語で言います\n\n您好、Opale老師。\n前幾次感謝您的精彩作品。這次我想請求您繪製朋友Vtuber澄花ハク的粉絲繪圖。\n\n關於參考圖，澄花ハク的下半身設定僅有Q版人物可以提供給您做參考，請見諒。\nhttps://x.com/SumikaHaku89/status/2015293771966226827/photo/1\nhttps://x.com/SumikaHaku89/status/2019709314152403079/photo/1\n（Q版例圖中抱著的為稱為澄子的粉絲形象，是頭上頂著柳橙的狗，如會在構圖內使用請您參考)\n他是治癒系的Vtuber，希望您能往這方向作構圖，但我沒有詳細的指定構圖，由您發揮。\n您的作品會作為禮物贈與對方，對方有可能會在推特公開張貼作品，請您知悉。\n\n感謝您的閱讀，希望您能接受這次的委託。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Opale/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3734548, "client_id": 1650088, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3a7b767/uploads/origins/ef6aaecb-b370-474b-b74c-d9c43383f321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c0d3032664872c7402e2776e479d20b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3a7b767/uploads/origins/ef6aaecb-b370-474b-b74c-d9c43383f321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c0d3032664872c7402e2776e479d20b, https://si.imgix.net/d3a7b767/uploads/origins/ef6aaecb-b370-474b-b74c-d9c43383f321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee7760cbbbb1df21c371fe90e885c111 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d3a7b767/uploads/origins/ef6aaecb-b370-474b-b74c-d9c43383f321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d50cadddfe6a39db4e9192340587d7a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3a7b767/uploads/origins/ef6aaecb-b370-474b-b74c-d9c43383f321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=43592c82e65d7a49722b4c21de551e97", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3a7b767/uploads/origins/ef6aaecb-b370-474b-b74c-d9c43383f321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=43592c82e65d7a49722b4c21de551e97, https://si.imgix.net/d3a7b767/uploads/origins/ef6aaecb-b370-474b-b74c-d9c43383f321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=37f3799d306a4d2bf3c62aab2d5335d0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d3a7b767/uploads/origins/ef6aaecb-b370-474b-b74c-d9c43383f321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0495db81789fce076238d618676b93a7 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは。あなたの作品が大好きで、私のオリジナルキャラクター（OC）をモチーフにした5:3のイラストを依頼したいです。( ´ ꒳ ` ) ♡\n\n私のOCの具体的な特徴は、参考画像の中で彼女の周りに丸で囲んであります。彼女は生意気で自信に満ちた性格です。\n今回は、より曲線美のある、大人びた体型の彼女を、メイスを持って、暗い背景の中で描いていただけると嬉しいです。また、シーンの周りにピンクの蝶が舞っていたり、地面からピンクの結晶が突き出ているような描写もぜひお願いします。\n\nもしよろしければ、このイラストを私の音楽やグッズ関連の活動に使わせてもらいたいです。金額が適切でない場合は、再送していただけると助かります。\n\nお時間を割いて、私の依頼を検討してくださり、本当にありがとうございます！(´｡• ω •｡`)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gnFptTvPTOz3AdVDJipFmPAt80q7Y35j", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Opale/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3734548, "client_id": 3864752, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3780c8bd/uploads/origins/b5a58b93-cad6-4ee0-aa80-698e50c53a25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e36dfd88610fd74117a00c3585a3da2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3780c8bd/uploads/origins/b5a58b93-cad6-4ee0-aa80-698e50c53a25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e36dfd88610fd74117a00c3585a3da2, https://si.imgix.net/3780c8bd/uploads/origins/b5a58b93-cad6-4ee0-aa80-698e50c53a25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f0c95b94a8345635d036f8ffdee334f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3780c8bd/uploads/origins/b5a58b93-cad6-4ee0-aa80-698e50c53a25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d99272a0edfa70047748bc770be10edf 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3780c8bd/uploads/origins/b5a58b93-cad6-4ee0-aa80-698e50c53a25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=95a968edd77e78d10e51d1da8e25229a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3780c8bd/uploads/origins/b5a58b93-cad6-4ee0-aa80-698e50c53a25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=95a968edd77e78d10e51d1da8e25229a, https://si.imgix.net/3780c8bd/uploads/origins/b5a58b93-cad6-4ee0-aa80-698e50c53a25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6d94706ebc270a9782611f5329cef981 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3780c8bd/uploads/origins/b5a58b93-cad6-4ee0-aa80-698e50c53a25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=56e54b78f68cb197ea23586ccc0303dd 3x"}, "body": "I'm so sorry I accidentally wrote your name wrong!\nNice to meet you! I fell in love with the style of your latest illustrations at first sight!\nI'd like to send you a request.\n\nWhat I'd like to ask for this time are my original characters—or rather, my avatars.\nI've compiled detailed reference materials in the link below.\n\n\nThe intended uses are:\n･Personal enjoyment (looking at them in my free time to make me smile, using them as desktop wallpaper, etc.)\n･Icons/headers for YouTube and Discord (I will credit you, Opale!)\nThat is all!\n\nI apologize for bothering you during such a busy time, but I would appreciate it if you could consider my request.\n\nRinraku\n\n\n\n\nCharacter Details/Background\n\n✦Character Details\n\nThe brown-haired one: “Rin” 20 years old, 160 cm\n\nLong dark brown hair (tied slightly to the back right) and orange eyes. Her distinctive feature is the two patterns on her cheeks.\nShe makes a conscious effort to maintain a gentle expression.\nHer tail isn’t a physical entity, so it appears and disappears at will. (Feel free to draw it or leave it out.)\n\nShe generally uses polite language and maintains a calm demeanor toward everyone.\nShe tries to be kind to younger people as an older sister figure, though she occasionally plays little pranks to tease them.\nCollege student.\n\n\n\nWhite-haired character: Raku ??? years old, 160 cm\n\nShe wears her white hair, tinged with a hint of jade green, in a carefree, unkempt style. Thanks to a mysterious power, her hair itself remains pristine. It’s enviable.\nOn both sides of her face, she wears \"mizura\"—bun-like hairstyles seen on haniwa figurines and men from the Kofun period.\nShe has eyes the same color as Rin’s, and the same pattern is engraved on her cheeks.\nThree lights glow in his pupils. In the dark, you can see them glowing slightly. (They look like inverted Mickey Mouse ears of the same size.)\nHe has seven pairs of ears on his head, each facing a different direction.\nHe has rounded eyebrows.\nHis entire body is covered in tattoo-like patterns.\nGenderless.\nHe has no tail or human ears.\n\n\nRarely comes out into the open.\nBasically has a gentle personality, but not as gentle as “Rin,” and has a strong laissez-faire side.\nBehaves with composure and lacks much human warmth.\n\n\n\nRelationship: Like two sides of the same coin, or yin and yang—they are a pair yet exist as a single entity.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vvHQn_mlXZiszXlfnd5LK8_yXPRVBnY3?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Opale/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3734548, "client_id": 499881, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4dfc8424e47b94b0b0807f526370be84", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4dfc8424e47b94b0b0807f526370be84, https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b9e03291710840d667fab14ed0819034 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e12914b745e72350d470973da189ea01 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dbf215a9ad2beb034579e249bf9831d8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8